--[[
	Raw form as given in template parameters.

	All numbers should be formatted as whole numbers with no separators
	(commas/underscores etc.) unless otherwise stated.
	@local
	@table raw_form
	@field {string} "Name" Name of unit.
	@field {string} "Base HP" Base HP (level 1, no treasures) of unit, numeric.
	@field {string} "Base AP" Base attack. Should be a comma-separated list.
	(e.g. `"1680"` for a single hit, or `"1680,1680,1680"` for three-hit
	multihit) of the damage for each attack.
	@field {string} "Range" Standing range; LD/Omni should only go in the
	abilities section.
	@field {string} "Foreswing" Time between attack starting and hits
	connecting, unit is frames. If unit has multihit, use a comma-separated list
	(e.g. `"5,10,20"` for Awakened Bahamut).
	@field {string} "Attack Cooldown" See Attack Timings page.
	@field {string} "Attack Length" Attack animation length, see Attack Timings
	page.
	@field {string} "Speed" Unit speed.
	@field {string} "KB" Amount of knockbacks before death.
	@field {string} "Cost" EoC chapter 1 cost of character.
	@field {string} "Recharge" Maximum recharge time of unit in frames.
	@field {string} "Attack Type" Single or Area Attack.
	@field {string} "Abilities" Unit's abilities.
	@field[opt] {string} "Stats Level" Level that stats should be shown at.
	Default is 30, except for Ultra Forms where it is 60. You can put + levels
	in (e.g. 1+30).
--]]

